5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 枪魂•一骑荡千军.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/kcvoinh9r814ya416yt1h7000o8ko86.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%9E%AA%E9%AD%82%E2%80%A2%E4%B8%80%E9%AA%91%E8%8D%A1%E5%8D%83%E5%86%9B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/kcvoinh9r814ya416yt1h7000o8ko86.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%9E%AA%E9%AD%82%E2%80%A2%E4%B8%80%E9%AA%91%E8%8D%A1%E5%8D%83%E5%86%9B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d4/kcvoinh9r814ya416yt1h7000o8ko86.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />枪魂•一骑荡千军\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（穿透伤害）对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有敌人造成物攻值<font color=\"#ed7950\">100%</font>的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]。攻击前消耗[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"杀气\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">杀气</font></span></span>]，每消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层，伤害倍率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>（最多消耗100层），并施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透易伤2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透易伤2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×被动技\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×被动技</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×反应技\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×反应技</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"附属被动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">附属被动</font></span></span>]，效果：主动以[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">非瞬发</span>]攻击后，若本技能没进入冷却，则自动释放，之后受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"一骑荡千军•势竭\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">一骑荡千军•势竭</font></span></span>]（持续2回合）。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-0 3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/ae/hp9k0iltoe2iq8n6u80ny5dwrlv7l6n.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/ae/hp9k0iltoe2iq8n6u80ny5dwrlv7l6n.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%88%97%E5%A5%A5%E5%B0%BC%E5%BE%B7%E2%80%A2%E5%AF%92%E9%94%8B%E8%A1%80%E8%AA%93\" title=\"角色图鉴库/列奥尼德•寒锋血誓\"><img alt=\"头像 列奥尼德•寒锋血誓.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/5e/psmyam389hualjbfd0utgnbr2hnjsbo.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">列奥尼德•寒锋血誓</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164342\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.468 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.656 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 10016/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 172750/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 21714/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  627.344      1 模板:技能\n100.00%  627.344      1 -total\n 13.41%   84.116      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n 12.65%   79.352      8 模板:中括号